!
! Script to install V1.0 of Geographical Database.
!
! (c) 1997 Fawnbench Ltd.
! E-mail: FawnBench@compuserve.com
!
! To use type the following:
!
!    A:
!    MCLINK -p<port> -b<baud-rate>
!    @INSTALL
!
! By default ALL the \APP\ files are transferred
! onto your Internal M: drive.  If you would like a
! different drive then you will need to change the M: to
! something else, e.g. B:
!
! Good luck...
!
COPY *.APP REM::M:\APP\
COPY *.DEF REM::M:\APP\MAP\
COPY *.IDX REM::M:\APP\MAP\
COPY *.GBN REM::M:\APP\MAP\
